"date_end":"2023-05-07","date_next":"2023-03-26","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":true,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,27],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Photographie"],"nl":["Galeries","Fotografie"],"en":["Art Galleries","Photography"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Fotografie"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Fotografia"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Fotograf\u00eda"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"1979-2023, l'Iran en r\u00e9volutions","shortdescr":"Face \u00e0 la trag\u00e9die qui se d\u00e9roule actuellement en Iran o\u00f9 le r\u00e9gime des Mollahs r\u00e9prime cruellement l\u2019aspiration du peuple \u00e0 la libert\u00e9, G\u00e9opolis pr\u00e9pare, de mars \u00e0 mai prochain, un cycle d\u2019expositions et une s\u00e9rie d\u2019activit\u00e9s (rencontres, plateaux radio) d\u00e9di\u00e9es \u00e0 la situation dans ce pays.","longdescr":"Cette exposition sera organis\u00e9e en deux parties, l\u2019une d\u00e9di\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019histoire du pays depuis la r\u00e9volution de 1979 et la seconde d\u00e9di\u00e9e \u00e0 la r\u00e9volte en cours.\r\n\r\nPremi\u00e8re partie de l\u2019exposition - R\u00e9trospective sur l\u2019histoire de l\u2019Iran.\r\nG\u00e9opolis a sollicit\u00e9 de tr\u00e8s grands photographes pour s\u2019associer \u00e0 ce projet (Reza, Alain Keler, Marie Tihon, Michel Setboun, \u00c9ric Bouvet).\r\nCes photographes proposeront une plong\u00e9e dans l\u2019histoire tumultueuse de l\u2019Iran depuis 1979.\r\nL\u2019exposition sera \u00e9galement pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e sur les vitres d\u2019un des b\u00e2timents de l\u2019IHECS et autour de l\u2019Ascenseur o\u00f9 seront organis\u00e9s \u00e9galement plusieurs plateaux radio d\u00e9di\u00e9s \u00e0 la situation en Iran.\r\n\r\nSeconde partie de l\u2019exposition - Femmes, vie, libert\u00e9.\r\nLa seconde partie de l\u2019exposition sera d\u00e9di\u00e9e \u00e0 la r\u00e9volte en cours suite \u00e0 la mort de Mahsa Amini et la mobilisation qui se d\u00e9roule actuellement en Iran.","performers":"\u00c9ric Bouvet, Alain Keler, Michel Setboun, Reza Deghati, Marie Tihon.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"nl":{"name":"1979-2023, Iran in revoluties","shortdescr":"Geconfronteerd met de tragedie die zich momenteel in Iran voltrekt, waar het regime van Mullahs het verlangen naar vrijheid van het volk op wrede wijze onderdrukt, bereidt Geopolis van maart tot mei een cyclus van tentoonstellingen en een reeks activiteiten (vergaderingen, radio-sets) voor die aan de situatie in dit land zijn gewijd.","longdescr":"Deze tentoonstelling zal worden georganiseerd in twee delen, \u00e9\u00e9n gewijd aan de geschiedenis van het land sinds de revolutie van 1979 en de tweede gewijd aan de huidige opstand.\r\n\r\nEerste deel van de tentoonstelling - Retrospective over de geschiedenis van Iran.\r\nGeopolis heeft zeer grote fotografen gevraagd om mee te doen aan dit project (Reza, Alain Keler, Marie Tihon, Michel Setboun, \u00c9ric Bouvet).\r\nDeze fotografen zullen een duik nemen in de tumultueuze geschiedenis van Iran sinds 1979.\r\nDe tentoonstelling zal ook worden gepresenteerd op de ramen van een van de gebouwen van het IHECS en rond de Lift, waar ook diverse radio-sets zullen worden georganiseerd die zijn gewijd aan de situatie in Iran.\r\n\r\nTweede deel van de tentoonstelling: Vrouwen, leven, vrijheid.\r\nHet tweede deel van de tentoonstelling zal gewijd zijn aan de voortdurende opstand na de dood van Mahsa Amini en de mobilisatie die momenteel plaatsvindt in Iran.Deze tentoonstelling zal worden georganiseerd in twee delen, \u00e9\u00e9n gewijd aan de geschiedenis van het land sinds de revolutie van 1979 en de tweede gewijd aan de huidige opstand.\r\n\r\nEerste deel van de tentoonstelling - Retrospective over de geschiedenis van Iran.\r\nGeopolis heeft zeer grote fotografen gevraagd om mee te doen aan dit project (Reza, Alain Keler, Marie Tihon, Michel Setboun, \u00c9ric Bouvet).\r\nDeze fotografen zullen een duik nemen in de tumultueuze geschiedenis van Iran sinds 1979.\r\nDe tentoonstelling zal ook worden gepresenteerd op de ramen van een van de gebouwen van het IHECS en rond de Lift, waar ook diverse radio-sets zullen worden georganiseerd die zijn gewijd aan de situatie in Iran.\r\n\r\nTweede deel van de tentoonstelling - Vrouwen, leven, vrijheid.\r\nHet tweede deel van de tentoonstelling zal gewijd zijn aan de voortdurende opstand na de dood van Mahsa Amini en de mobilisatie die momenteel plaatsvindt in Iran.","performers":"\u00c9ric Bouvet, Alain Keler, Michel Setboun, Reza Deghati, Marie Tihon.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"en":{"name":"1979-2023, Iran in revolutions","shortdescr":"Faced with the tragedy currently unfolding in Iran where the Mullahs regime is cruelly repressing the people\u2019s desire for freedom, Geopolis is preparing, from March to next May, a cycle of exhibitions and a series of activities (meetings, radio sets) dedicated to the situation in this country.","longdescr":"This exhibition will be organized in two parts, one dedicated to the history of the country since the 1979 revolution and the second dedicated to the current revolt.\r\n\r\nFirst part of the exhibition - Retrospective on the history of Iran.\r\nGeopolis has asked very great photographers to join this project (Reza, Alain Keler, Marie Tihon, Michel Setboun, \u00c9ric Bouvet).\r\nThese photographers will offer a dive into the tumultuous history of Iran since 1979.\r\nThe exhibition will also be presented on the windows of one of the buildings of the IHECS and around the Elevator where will also be organized several radio sets dedicated to the situation in Iran.\r\n\r\nSecond part of the exhibition - Women, life, freedom.\r\nThe second part of the exhibition will be dedicated to the ongoing revolt following the death of Mahsa Amini and the mobilization currently taking place in Iran.","performers":"\u00c9ric Bouvet, Alain Keler, Michel Setboun, Reza Deghati, Marie Tihon.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"de":{"name":"Iran","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"it":{"name":"Iran","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"sp":{"name":"Iran","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"pt":{"name":"Iran","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"},"cn":{"name":"Iran","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550164"}},"place":{"id":269816,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Geopolis","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 58-60","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"G\u00e9opolis est parrain\u00e9 par le photoreporter de guerre Laurent Van der Stockt, et port\u00e9 par trois militants associatifs, passionn\u00e9s de g\u00e9opolitique. Cet espace culturel d\u00e9di\u00e9 au photo-reportage d\u2019actualit\u00e9 et d\u2019histoire est install\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles (aux Ateliers des Tanneurs) et propose des cycles d\u2019expositions th\u00e9matiques et une programmation \u00e9v\u00e9nementielle tourn\u00e9e vers le grand public et notamment les jeunes.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Geopolis","address_street_name":"Huidevettersstraat","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Huidevettersstraat, 58-60","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"G\u00e9opolis is een centrum voor fotojournalistiek en onderwijs opgericht in 2017 door een klein team met een passie voor geopolitiek. Door fototentoonstellingen en didactische tentoonstellingen te combineren met evenementen en een radioprogramma, beoogt ze actuele vraagstukken bespreekbaar te maken. Het centrum, gevestigd in de Ateliers des Tanneurs op een bijzondere en polyvalente locatie, organiseert tentoonstellingen over actuele en geschiedkundige thema\u2019s met werk van zowel gevestigde fotografen als jonge talenten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Geopolis","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 58-60","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"G\u00e9opolis","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 58-60","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"G\u00e9opolis","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 58-60","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles