Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers et Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum is an independent art centre, created in 2014. Born from the ashes of the Atelier 340 Muzeum, its main mission is the study and promotion of sculpture and three-dimensional art in Belgium and abroad.\r\nAtelier 34zero Muzeum organises 3 to 4 exhibitions a year in its own spaces as well as several events extra muros. Three types of exhibitions are organised: thematic, confrontational or comparative, and personal (retrospectives). These are accompanied by quality publications; quadrilingual and richly illustrated catalogues, and postcards. \r\nAlong with its exhibitions, Atelier 34zero Muzeum is building up a collection of artworks as a memory of past activities and a tool for further questioning. It contains work of Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers and  Christine Wilm\u00e8s, among others.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Die Geb\u00e4ude und der Park bergen einen Ausstellungraum, ein Dokumentationszentrum, eine Fachbuchhandlung, einen Ausstellungsgarten und ein Caf\u00e9. Die Sammlung umfasst Werke von Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers und Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line