p een originele manier te verkennen? Dan zijn onze rondleidingen beslist iets voor u!\r\nDeze stadsroutes met verschillende thema's behandelen kwesties die diep geworteld zitten in het verleden, maar waarvan het heden ons dagelijks interpelleert: wie arbeid of industrie zegt, spreekt meteen ook over stedelijke groei, immigratie, sociale hulp, woningen. Sommige bezoeken zijn geconcentreerd op een wijk, andere gaan over economische, politieke of sociale kwesties. Er zijn een twintigtal routes voor een gevarieerd publiek beschikbaar in meerdere talen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Fonderie - Brussels museum of work and industry","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":" La Fonderie's tour guides invite visitors to discover Brussels so they may better understand and analyse the city.\r\nThe urban guided tours with their varied themes address questions deeply rooted in the past but which relate to modern, everyday life such as: work, industrial techniques, urban growth, immigration, social welfare and housing. Some visits concentrate on a neighbourhood; others ask questions related to economic, political or social issues. More than twenty tours are available in several languages for a large and diverse public.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Fonderie - Br\u00fcsseler Museum f\u00fcr Industrie und Arbeit","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+3