ble","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Appareils d'amplification du son","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Geluidsversterkende apparatuur","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Sound-amplifying equipment","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","H\u00f6rverst\u00e4rker","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Apparecchi acustici","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Aparatos de amplificaci\u00f3n del sonido","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-18T04:06:48+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-02T15:19:11+01:00","backoffice_id":270855,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":553521,"date_start":"2023-03-29","date_end":"2023-03-30","date_next":"2023-03-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater","it":"Teatro","sp":"Teatro","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"],"it":["Teatro"],"sp":["Teatro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mute (Nuit 1 : Les Nuits du Magic Hall)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00ab Quand les souvenirs font du bruit, la douleur est muette \u00bb\r\nUne vie r\u00e9ussie comporte une succession de bonheurs ; une enfance heureuse, une famille soud\u00e9e, des amis proches, un boulot \u00e9panouissant, et\u2026 Evidemment la rencontre de son \u00e9lue, la moiti\u00e9 de son \u00e2me, sa dulcin\u00e9e, sa ch\u00e9rie, sa biquette, son chouchou\u2026 Peu importe le petit nom utilis\u00e9, du moment que vous vous aimez !\r\n\r\nElle peut arriver \u00e0 n\u2019importe quel moment, repartir instantan\u00e9ment, rester amoureusement ou bien s\u2019en aller sans en avoir le choix\u2026 C\u2019est au tour de Luther, 30 ans, tavernier \u00e9picurien, d\u2019\u00eatre cibl\u00e9 par Cupidon un apr\u00e8s-midi d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9. Il rencontre Lucie et, ensemble, ils vivront tous deux un amour fr\u00e9n\u00e9tique.\r\nRien ne pourrait les s\u00e9parer, rien\u2026hormis le destin !\r\nDurant ses 40 ann\u00e9es de deuil, Luther attend impatiemment le deuxi\u00e8me rendez-vous le plus important de sa vie, ou plut\u00f4t le rendez-vous le plus important de toute sa mort.\r\nAvec : Laurent Dauvill\u00e9e\r\n\r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne de Dany Marbaix","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"chloe@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 42","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 42","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553521"},"nl":{"name":"Mute (Nuit 1: Les Nuits du Magic Hall)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"chloe@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 42","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 42","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/e