mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile","Parcheggio accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado","Estacionamiento habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-03-26T03:36:53+02:00","published_at":"2021-03-04T10:14:24+01:00","backoffice_id":229486,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.10319362513019},{"id":550442,"date_start":"2023-03-31","date_end":"2023-03-31","date_next":"2023-03-31","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert","it":"Concerti","sp":"Concierto","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"it":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk e Country"],"sp":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, folk y country"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":"Consid\u00e9r\u00e9 comme l\u2019un des meilleurs guitaristes du Mali, Samba Tour\u00e9 a grandi dans la r\u00e9gion de Tombouctou. Il perp\u00e9tue l\u2019h\u00e9ritage musical l\u00e9gendaire immense d\u2019Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, \u00ab roi du blues africain \u00bb, d\u00e9c\u00e9d\u00e9 en 2006.","longdescr":"Consid\u00e9r\u00e9 comme l\u2019un des meilleurs guitaristes du Mali, Samba Tour\u00e9 a grandi dans la r\u00e9gion de Tombouctou. Il perp\u00e9tue l\u2019h\u00e9ritage musical l\u00e9gendaire immense d\u2019Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, \u00ab roi du blues africain \u00bb, d\u00e9c\u00e9d\u00e9 en 2006.\r\n\r\nAvec Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, Samba a fait le tour du monde \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de multiples tendances musicales qu\u2019il combine avec le style de l\u2019Afrique de l\u2019Ouest. Le r\u00e9sultat : un son \u00e9clectique, exp\u00e9rimental et unique avec lequel il fait l\u2019unanimit\u00e9 et qui a convaincu un grand public dans son pays natal et partout ailleurs. Apr\u00e8s le succ\u00e8s de \u2018Wande\u2019, Samba Tour\u00e9 rend hommage \u00e0 ses racines et \u00e0 la musique Songha\u00ef avec son nouvel album \u2018Binga\u2019 (Glitterbeat). Parfois qualifi\u00e9 de mani\u00e8re restrictive de \u00ab blues du d\u00e9sert \u00bb, il propose en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 un grand nombre de styles et d\u2019artistes diff\u00e9rents. Avec son groove puissant et raffin\u00e9, Samba veut transmettre \u00e0 son public l\u2019essence-m\u00eame de la musique Songha\u00ef. Ce qu\u2019il sublime avec le ma\u00eetre ngoni Djim\u00e9 Sissoko et le grand Souleymane Kane aux percussions.","performers":"Samba Tour\u00e9\r\nDjim\u00e9 Sissoko et Souleymane Kane: percussions","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"nl":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":"Samba Tour\u00e9 wordt door velen beschouwd als \u00e9\u00e9n van de beste gitaristen van Mali. Hij groeide op in de regio van Timboektoe en is de muzikale erfgenaam van de legendarische Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, de in 2006 overleden \u2018koning van de woestijnblues\u2019.","longdescr":"Samba Tour\u00e9 wordt door velen beschouwd als \u00e9\u00e9n van de beste gitaristen van Mali. Hij groeide op in de regio van Timboektoe en is de muzikale erfgenaam van de legendarische Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, de in 2006 overleden \u2018koning van de woestijnblues\u2019.\r\n\r\nSamen met Ali Farka Tour\u00e9 tourde Samba de wereld rond en ontdekte hij vele nieuwe muziekstijlen die hij combineerde met West-Afrikaanse muziekstijlen. Het resultaat: een uniek experimenteel eclectisch geluid waarmee hij zowel in zijn thuisland als in de rest van de wereld een grote groep fans achter zich heeft weten te scharen. Na de release van zijn succesvolle album \u2018Wande\u2019 keerde Samba Tour\u00e9 vorig jaar met opvolger \u2018Binga\u2019 (Glitterbeat) terug naar zijn originele wortels, de Songha\u00ef muziek. Deze stijl wordt (te) makkelijk als \u2018woestijnblues\u2019 geafficheerd, terwijl dat label zo vele stijlen en artiesten omvat waar nauwelijks verbanden tussen zijn. Songha\u00ef muziek heeft zijn eigen kenmerken en codes die Samba graag wil laten horen aan zijn publiek. Die brengt hij samen met ngoni-meester Djim\u00e9 Sissoko en de geweldige Souleymane Kane op percussie.","performers":"Samba Tour\u00e9\r\nDjim\u00e9 Sissoko et Souleymane Kane: percussie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"en":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":"Considered one of the best guitarists in Mali, Samba Tour\u00e9 grew up in the Timbuktu region. He perpetuates the immense legendary musical heritage of Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, \"king of African blues\", who died in 2006.","longdescr":"Considered one of the best guitarists in Mali, Samba Tour\u00e9 grew up in the Timbuktu region. He perpetuates the immense legendary musical heritage of Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, \"king of African blues\", who died in 2006.\r\n\r\nWith Ali Farka Tour\u00e9, Samba has traveled the world discovering multiple musical trends that he combines with the style of West Africa. The result: an eclectic, experimental and unique sound with which he is unanimous and which has won over a large audience in his native country and everywhere else. After the success of 'Wande', Samba Tour\u00e9 pays homage to his roots and to Songha\u00ef music with his new album 'Binga' (Glitterbeat). Sometimes referred to narrowly as \"desert blues\", it actually features a large number of different styles and artists. With his powerful and refined groove, Samba wants to convey to his audience the very essence of Songhai music. What he sublimates with the master ngoni Djim\u00e9 Sissoko and the great Souleymane Kane on percussion.","performers":"Samba Tour\u00e9\r\nDjim\u00e9 Sissoko et Souleymane Kane: percussion","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"de":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"it":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"sp":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"pt":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"},"cn":{"name":"Samba Tour\u00e9 (Mali)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550442"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Nam