s que le quartier des Marolles, le March\u00e9 aux Poissons, le Palais de Justice,... et les sentiers moins battus de la ville. Ce tour vous offre une vue surprenante sur la ville, son patrimoine et sa diversit\u00e9. \r\n\r\n\u00c0 mi-parcours, les v\u00e9los sont mis de c\u00f4t\u00e9 pour une pause dans un bar sympathique ou sur une terrasse.  \r\n\r\nD\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne l'imaginez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo ! \r\n\r\nInfos pratiques: \r\n- Tous les samedis, tours en FR, NL et EN\r\n- Avec votre propre v\u00e9lo ou un v\u00e9lo classique ou e-bike \u00e0 nous\r\n- Dur\u00e9e: 3h30\r\n- D\u00e9part et arriv\u00e9e dans le centre-ville au Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"nl":{"name":"Zaterdagtour - Ontdek Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":"Ontdek Brussel, langs highlights en minder betreden paden met de fiets en laat je verrassen!","longdescr":"De zaterdagtour is een ideale kennismaking met Brussel, haar diversiteit aan wijken en haar vele gezichten. Onze gidsen maken van deze tour een boeiende mix tussen highlights zoals de Marollen, de Vismarkt of het Justitiepaleis en de minder betreden paden van de stad. Een verrassende blik op de stad en haar veelzijdigheid want Brussel is veel meer dan haar klassieke highlights!\r\n\r\nHalverwege de tour gaan de fietsen aan de kant voor een pauze in een gezellige bar of terrasje.\r\n\r\nOntdek meer dan je zou verwachten, met de fiets!\r\n\r\nPraktische info: \r\n- Elke zaterdag tours in NL, FR en EN\r\n- Met je eigen fiets of een klassieke fiets of e-bike van ons\r\n- Duur: 3u30\r\n- Vertrek en einde in het stadscentrum, Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"en":{"name":"Saturday tour - Discover Brussels by bike","shortdescr":"Discover Brussels, its highlights and less beaten tracks by bike and let yourself be surprised!","longdescr":"The Saturday tour is an ideal introduction to Brussels, its various neighbourhoods and many identities. During this tour, our guides offer you an interesting mix between highlights such as the Marolles, the Fish Market or the Palace of Justice and hidden gems along the city's less beaten tracks. A surprising view on the city, its heritage and versatility.\r\n\r\nThe bikes are set aside halfway the tour for a break at a cosy bar or terrace. \r\n\r\nDiscover more than you can imagine by bike!\r\n\r\nPractical info: \r\n- Every Saturday, tours in EN, FR and NL\r\n- With your own bike or with one of our classic or e-bikes\r\n- Time: 3h30\r\n- Start and end of the tours in the city center, Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"de":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"it":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14",