e rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. Avant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider hors des chemins battus et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. Vivez Bruxelles dans toute sa splendeur \u00e0 v\u00e9lo et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een vereniging van lokale vrijwillige gidsen met een passie voor Brussel en de fiets. Ze delen hun passie voor de stad en het fietsen enthousiast met bezoekers van Brussel en andere Brusselaars. Op hun fietsen vinden ze het juiste tempo om u onder te dompelen in de stad en u een authentieke Brusselse ervaring te bieden. Bovenal begeleiden ze jullie graag buiten de gebaande paden in een vriendelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel in al zijn pracht per fiets en ontdek meer dan jullie denken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an association of local volunteer guides with a passion for Brussels and cycling. They enthusiastically share their passion for the city and cycling with visitors to Brussels and other Brussels residents. On their bikes they find the right pace to immerse you in the city and offer an authentic Brussels experience. Above all, they prefer to guide you off the beaten track in a friendly atmosphere. Experience Brussels in all its splendour by bike and discover more than you think.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","ad