hibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,39],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Photographie"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Fotografie"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Photography"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Fotografie"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Fotografia"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Fotograf\u00eda"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":"\u201cStratigraphies\" se penche sur le concept des \"lieux fant\u00f4mes\" et sur la mani\u00e8re dont ils restent grav\u00e9s dans nos m\u00e9moires longtemps apr\u00e8s leur disparition.  L\u2019utilisation du sel et de l\u2019eau de Transylvanie comme mat\u00e9riaux de base \u00e0 l\u2019impression des photographies reconnecte aux territoires effac\u00e9s.  \r\nTirages aux sels de la mine de Turda - Transylvanie.","longdescr":"Les photos vernaculaires de Roumanie pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es en contre-champ au travail de Cristina Epure \u00e0 la Tiny Gallery sont issues des collections anciennes du Mus\u00e9e Astra \u00e0 Sibiu. Le mus\u00e9e ASTRA est l'un des mus\u00e9es publics les plus dynamiques de Roumanie en mati\u00e8re de pr\u00e9servation et de promotion active du patrimoine culturel mat\u00e9riel et immat\u00e9riel \u00e0 valeur ethnographique. T\u00e9moignages photographiques d\u2019une civilisation rurale, les images sont le miroir du rapport de l\u2019homme souvent seul face \u00e0 son espace souvent immense.  Les tirages contemporains r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par la technique ancienne du papier sal\u00e9 inscrivent les photographies dans une permanence de la mati\u00e8re. \r\nTirages aux sels de la mine de Turda - Transylvanie.  \r\n\r\nPhotographies Cristina Epure\r\nProc\u00e9d\u00e9s photographiques anciens Olivier Guyaux \r\nArchives Mus\u00e9e Astra Sibiu","performers":"Cristina Epure, Olivier Guyaux, Bi\u00e9nnale de la Photographie de Molembeek-Saint-Jean","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"nl":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":"Stratigraphies\" kijkt naar het concept van \"spookplaatsen\" en hoe ze in ons geheugen gegrift blijven lang nadat ze zijn verdwenen. Het gebruik van zout en water uit Transsylvani\u00eb als basismateriaal voor het afdrukken van foto's brengt opnieuw verbinding met gewiste gebieden.\r\nZoutafdrukken uit de Turda-mijn - Transsylvani\u00eb.","longdescr":"De lokale foto's van Roemeni\u00eb die als tegenhanger van het werk van Cristina Epure in de Tiny Gallery worden gepresenteerd, zijn afkomstig uit de oude collecties van het Astra Museum in Sibiu. Het ASTRA-museum is een van de meest dynamische openbare musea in Roemeni\u00eb wat betreft het behoud en de actieve promotie van materieel en immaterieel cultureel erfgoed van etnografische waarde. Fotografische getuigenissen van een landelijke beschaving, de beelden zijn de spiegel van de relatie van de mens , vaak alleen voor zijn vaak immense ruimte.  De hedendaagse prints geproduceerd door de oude techniek van gezouten papier schrijven de foto's in een permanentie van het materiaal .\r\nZoutafdrukken uit de Turda-mijn - Transsylvani\u00eb.  \r\nSalt Paper Prints\r\nFoto's Cristina Epure\r\nOude fotografische processen Olivier Guyaux\r\nArchief Astra Sibiu-museum","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"en":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":"Stratigraphies\" looks at the concept of \"ghost places \" and how they remain etched in our memories long after they have disappeared. The use of salt and water from Transylvania as basic materials for printing photographs reconnects with erased territories . Salt prints from the Turda mine - Transylvania.","longdescr":"The vernacular photos of Romania presented as a counter-shot to the work of Cristina Epure at the Tiny Gallery come from the old collections of the Astra Museum in Sibiu. The ASTRA Museum is one of the most dynamic public museums in Romania in terms of the preservation and active promotion of tangible and intangible cultural heritage of ethnographic value. Photographic testimonies of a rural civilization, the images are the mirror of the relationship of man , often alone in front of his often immense space.  The contemporary prints produced by the ancient technique of salted paper inscribe the photographs in a permanence of the material .\r\nSalt prints from the Turda mine - Transylvania.  \r\nPhotographs Cristina Epure\r\nOld photographic processes Olivier Guyaux\r\nArchives Astra Sibiu Museum","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"de":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"it":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"sp":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"pt":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"},"cn":{"name":"Stratigraphies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","email":"ogc@ogc.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553777"}},"place":{"id":275243,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La TinyGallery - Petit mus\u00e9e de la photographie amateur - veut conserver la photographie amateur et rendre hommage \u00e0 leurs auteurs, ces artistes anonymes.\r\n\r\nIntentionnelle ou accidentelle, la photographie amateur nous fascine par ses cr\u00e9ations spontan\u00e9es. Instants magiques et bruts o\u00f9 nous entrons dans l\u2019intimit\u00e9 de ces inconnus \u00e0 plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle de distance. Clins d'oeil \u00e0 la vanit\u00e9 de l'\u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re, ces fant\u00f4mes bienveillants longtemps prot\u00e9g\u00e9s dans l\u2019ombre des albums nous surprennent par leur proximit\u00e9. Albums d\u00e9piaut\u00e9s, dispers\u00e9s, brocant\u00e9s, se livrant et sans d\u00e9fenses, ils sont les t\u00e9moins d\u2019un temps o\u00f9 la photographie n'\u00e9tait pas consid\u00e9r\u00e9e comme dangereuse. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Kuipstraat","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kuipstraat, 26","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"TinyGallery - Klein museum voor amateurfotografie - wil de amateurfotografie conserveren en hulde brengen aan hun auteurs, deze anonieme kunstenaars.\r\n\r\nAmateurfotografie fascineert ons door de spontane creaties. Ze ontstaan doelbewust of ongewild, die magische en authentieke fragmenten van de intimiteit van onbekenden die meer dan een eeuw geleden leefden. Een knipoog naar de ijdelheid van het kortstondige, welwillende geesten die lang beschermd waren in de schaduw van vergeten albums. Ze verrassen ons met hun nabijheid, intieme albums die weerloos opengerukt eindigden op de rommelmarkt, stille getuigen van een tijd waarin fotografie niet als gevaarlijk werd beschouwd. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"TinyGallery - Small museum of amateur photography - wishes to preserve amateur photography and pay tribute to the anonymous artists who authored them.\r\n\r\nWhether produced intentionally or accidentally, amateur photography fascinates us with its spontaneous creations. Magical, raw moments are captured, allowing us an intimate insight into the lives of strangers who lived over a century ago. In a nod to the vanity of the ephemeral, these benevolent ghosts, who have long been protected by the shadows of the past, surprise us with their proximity. Battered and bruised albums scattered over flea markets surrender to us defencelessly, bearing witness to a time when photography was not considered dangerous. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"TinyGallery Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la Cuve","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"ogc@ogc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tinygallery.photo","phone_contact":"+32 475 27 95 56","phone_booking":"+32 472 27 95 56","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Cuve, 26","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtua