"pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,28],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Arts graphiques"],"nl":["Galeries","Grafische kunst, vormgeving"],"en":["Art Galleries","Graphic art"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Grafische K\u00fcnste"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Arti grafiche"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Artes gr\u00e1ficas"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"\u201cF.R.E.A.K.\u201d de Frej.a Korsbaek","shortdescr":"\u00ab F.R.E.A.K. \u2013 Un grain de poussi\u00e8re et un univers entier \u00e0 la fois \u00bb, une exposition autobiographique de 8 dessins spontan\u00e9s ex\u00e9cut\u00e9s en techniques mixtes.","longdescr":"\u00ab F.R.E.A.K. \u2013 Un grain de poussi\u00e8re et un univers entier \u00e0 la fois \u00bb, une exposition autobiographique de 8 dessins spontan\u00e9s ex\u00e9cut\u00e9s en techniques mixtes. C\u2019est par le dessin, son art de pr\u00e9dilection, que Frej\u00b7a affirme ses diff\u00e9rences, refusant d\u2019oublier sa transidentit\u00e9 et ses homosexualit\u00e9s dans une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 contraignant l\u2019individu. R\u00e9volt\u00e9 r\u00e9silient, l\u2019artiste veut partager aujourd\u2019hui ce cheminement charg\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9motions humaines. Car les discriminations, quelles qu\u2019elles soient, ne se reposent pas. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019expression de ses mouvements d\u2019\u00e2me, l\u2019artiste insiste sur l\u2019unit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00eatre, peu importe sa dimension, son lieu ou son temps.\r\n\r\nInformations\u00a0:\r\n\r\n\u00c0 l'Accueil de l'Espace Car\u00eame, 1-7 rue du Chapelain pendant les heures d'ouverture\r\n\r\nT\u00e9l.\u00a0: 02\/526.83.30 et 02\/526.83.40\r\n\r\nMail\u00a0:  emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels\r\n\r\nA l\u2019initiative de Fabrice Cumps, Bourgmestre et \u00e9chevin de la culture, \u00e0 l\u2019initiative de J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Drouart, \u00c9chevin de l\u2019\u00c9galit\u00e9 des Chances et avec le soutien du Coll\u00e8ge Echevinal d\u2019Anderlecht, de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles \u2014Direction G\u00e9n\u00e9rale de la Culture- Service G\u00e9n\u00e9ral des Lettres et du Livre et de la Commission Communautaire Fran\u00e7aise de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. E.R. : Marcel Vermeulen","performers":"Artiste : Frej.a Korsbaek","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/iamproud","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553628"},"nl":{"name":"\u201cF.R.E.A.K.\u201d de Frej.a Korsbaek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/iamproud","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 40","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553628"},"en":{"name":"\u201cF.R.E.A.K.\u201d de Frej.a Korsbaek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/iamproud","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553628"},"de":{"name":"Exposition \u201cF.R.E.A.K.\u201d de Frej.a Korsbaek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/iamproud","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553628"},"it":{"name":"Exposition \u201cF.R.E.A.K.\u201d de Frej.a Korsbaek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.emca.be\/iamproud","email":"emca.reservations@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 