es cosmopolite, candeur et intensit\u00e9","longdescr":"Le trio de jeunes femmes qui se tient sur sc\u00e8ne appara\u00eet comme fragile et puissant. Rejointes pour l\u2019occasion par Samir Barris, elles \u00e9voluent entre le rire et les larmes \u00e0 l\u2019instar de leurs influences musicales. Les clarinettes, guitare, accord\u00e9on et ukul\u00e9l\u00e9 dansent avec les m\u00e9lodies et les harmonies du klezmer, du blues du fado et flirtent parfois avec le folk et le hip hop. Mais plus que de simples complaintes, ils sont aussi porteurs d\u2019espoir, de joie et de r\u00eaverie.","performers":"Sura Solomon; Amber in 't Veld; Marieke Werner; Samir Barris","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bxl.kidzik.be\/programme\/337\/las-lloronas","email":"info@kidzik.be","phone_contact":"+32 10 23 74 14","phone_booking":"+32 10 23 74 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551885"},"nl":{"name":"Las Lloronas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bxl.kidzik.be\/programme\/337\/las-lloronas","email":"info@kidzik.be","phone_contact":"+32 10 23 74 14","phone_booking":"+32 10 23 74 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551885"},"en":{"name":"Las Lloronas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bxl.kidzik.be\/programme\/337\/las-lloronas","email":"info@kidzik.be","phone_contact":"+32 10 23 74 14","phone_booking":"+32 10 23 74 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551885"},"de":{"name":"Las Lloronas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bxl.kidzik.be\/programme\/337\/las-lloronas","email":"info@kidzik.be","phone_contact":"+32 10 23 74 14","phone_booking":"+32 10 23 74 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551885"},"it":{"name":"Las Lloronas","shor