nous parle, avec l\u2019humour et la tendresse qu\u2019on lui conna\u00eet, des temp\u00eates qui l\u2019avaient brusquement \u00e9loign\u00e9 de ses proches. Il n\u2019avait que sept ans quand il fut \u00e9loign\u00e9 de sa famille ! Envoy\u00e9 seul loin de Bruxelles, dans une campagne d\u00e9serte, o\u00f9 boudins, compotes et autres rollmops remplac\u00e8rent les d\u00e9licieux tajines de sa grand-m\u00e8re.\r\n\r\nHeureusement, il a surv\u00e9cu pour nous dire comment y parvenir !","performers":"Avec Ben Hamidou | Texte Ben Hamidou, Gennaro Pitisci et Ma\u00eft\u00e9 Renson | Mise en sc\u00e8ne Gennaro Pitisci, assist\u00e9 de Ma\u00eft\u00e9 Renson | R\u00e9gie : David Vernaillen, Josse Derbaix, Claude Taymans.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"nl":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"en":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"de":{"name":"Ah! Les jolies colonies","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549899"},"it"